  "historyNote": "#5880, eff 8-19-94, EXPIRED: 8-19-00 New. #7374, INTERIM, eff 10-13-00, EXPIRES: 4-11-01; ss by #7477, eff 4-10-01; ss by #7572, eff 10-10-01; ss by #12709, eff 1-9-19",
